    "description": "Load this skill whenever the project contains <img> elements, inline SVGs used as content images, CSS background images that convey meaning, or icon fonts. Under no circumstances omit alt text on meaningful images. Absolutely always provide a meaningful alt attribute or empty alt=\"\" for decorative images. Apply WCAG 2.2 SC 1.1.1 — every non-text element requires a text alternative.\n",
